; SniperTurtle_KZ_v1.00  -  FundedNext Stellar 1-Step $25K
; ATTACH TO XAUUSD  M5  -  NOT M15, NOT M3.
;
; KILLZONES: ASIA + NEW YORK.  LONDON IS OFF.
;   InpKzAsia=true  InpKzLondon=FALSE  InpKzNY=true
;
; ================= WHY LONDON IS OFF =================
; Traded ALONE, London is positive in 1 year of 4 - on all three timeframes:
;     M15 total -1113      M5 total -3821      M3 total -5367
; Nothing else in this project has been that consistent across frames, and
; unlike every "best of N" result here it is a NEGATIVE finding, so it cannot
; be a lucky draw - it was not what anyone was looking for.
;
; Dropping it is the only combination positive in 3 of 4 years on EVERY
; timeframe (no prop guards, so the guards cannot be flattering it):
;     asia+NY   M15 +6603   M5 +2996   M3 +6670     3/4 each
;     all three M15 +6940   M5 +7737   M3 -2522     3/4, 2/4, 2/4
; All three killzones beats asia+NY on M5 and then goes NEGATIVE on M3,
; because it is carrying London's losses.
;
; ================= WHY M5, NOT M15 =================
; This exact config, these guards, per timeframe over four years:
;
;            passes   which years          breaches
;   M15       2/4     2025, 2026              0
;   M5        3/4     2023, 2024, 2026        0
;   M3        1/4     2026                    0
;
; 2025 and 2026 are the years every config in this project was SELECTED on.
; M15 passes in exactly those two and nowhere else, which is what a fitted
; result looks like. M5 passes in 2023 and 2024 - both unseen - plus 2026,
; and misses only 2025. It is the first thing here that did BETTER on data it
; was not chosen from.
;
; M5 was ruled out earlier, correctly at the time: with London ON it drew down
; 20.1%, far past the 6% limit. Removing London is what fixed it -
;            2023      2024      2025      2026
;   all 3    no tgt    no tgt    PASS      PASS
;   asia+NY  PASS      PASS      no tgt    PASS
; Worst trough on M5 asia+NY is -882 of the -1500, worst day -356 of the -750.
; NO BREACH in any year, on any timeframe, in any combination.
;
; Expect roughly 150-190 trades a year on M5 - about 3 a week. On M15 it would
; be ~37 a year, about 3 a month.
;
; ================= WHAT IT IS =================
;   EMA 50/100/200, TRAIL OFF. Neither works without the other: 50/100 with
;   the trail on made -323 across 2025, with it off +4889. The slow signal
;   produces a payoff near 22, so winners have to be allowed to run.
;   Quality filter ON with VWAP the only condition - ADX and EMA-separation
;   were the two WORST filters tested and both ship on by default.
;   Killzone window on, 60-minute lead. No server session filter.
;   Guards: daily -600 (flatten), 3 losing trades, static DD, halt at -1200.
;
; ================= BEFORE YOU START =================
;   * Fill InpTgToken / InpTgChatId on the machine. Never in the repo.
;   * Verify InpServerGmtOffset against the broker. The killzone window is cut
;     from a NY clock derived from it, and is the only time gate here.
;   * Demo it first. Every number above is a backtest.
;
; ================= THE HONEST ODDS =================
; 2 of the last 4 years reached +2500; the other 2 drifted without breaching.
; With no time limit on this plan that costs patience rather than the account.
; But 2025 and 2026 - the two it passes - are the two years this whole line of
; configs was selected on. London's failure is the robust finding here.
; "Passes 2 of 4" is not yet one.
